  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1306.07 Emergency Exits. Emergency exits shall not be used as an entrance or an exit, except in the event of an emergency or an emergency evacuation drill.\n\nSource. #4873, eff 07-24-90; ss by #6297, eff 7-23-96; ss by #8122, INTERIM, eff 7-17-04, EXPIRES: 1-13-05; ss and moved by #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1316.07); ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
